name: Link Analysis provider billing fraud showcase
tagline: "A seeded payer program-integrity Link Analysis demo - referral kickbacks, phantom billing, a pill mill and upcoding, planted among 20 000 members, 1 500 providers and 80 000 claim lines with benign look-alikes"
description: "The health-insurer and public-payer program-integrity Link Analysis demo as a Space Template, Basic tier. Nine synthetic feeds (address, owner, provider, provider_owner, member, claim_line, admission, referral, prescription; 12 months landed from 2025-10-01 in data/inbox, the next month in data/staged; 20 000 members, 1 500 providers and about 1 300 owners, about 81 000 claim lines, 2 800 hospital stays, 14 000 referrals and 30 000 prescriptions) are landed by nine Collectors and Pipelines. The health_links Job folds them into ONE link Dataset (src, dst, kind, ts, amount, event_date, via) of six link kinds; the health_screen_links Job derives the four program-integrity screens the saved views read. Planted stories (ground truth: tools/gen-la-health-data.ground-truth.json; pinned by HealthLinksJobGoldenTest and tools/gen-la-health-data.test.mjs): 2 practices send 85 % of their referrals to an imaging centre whose owner shares a home with one practice's owner; a physiotherapy clinic bills 40 patients for sessions while they were in hospital elsewhere or after they died; a pain clinic prescribes large strong-opioid quantities to 70 patients who live over 50 km away and mostly pay cash, filled at 2 pharmacies; 3 urgent-care clinics in 3 cities under one owner bill the top visit level about 4 times what their patients' ages predict. Benign look-alikes that must not join a story: a seaside practice referring to the only hospital nearby, a clinic whose date errors were reversed within a week, an oncology centre with local insured patients, and an elderly-care clinic whose patients really are over 80. Four saved views. Runs on every edition, Basic included: no sign-in personas, Alert Rules or Investigations. Synthetic data only."
minEdition: basic
icon: heroicons_outline:heart
contents[5]: "9 Collectors + Pipelines + Datasets (12 months landed, 1 month staged)", "health_links Job + Dataset (6 link kinds, via) and the health_screen_links Dataset of four program-integrity screens", "4 saved views (referral concentration, billed in hospital or after death, strong-opioid prescribers, top-level visit billing)", "4 planted stories with benign look-alikes", "Ground truth and golden tests in the repository"
